        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 24570, Rope Pattern Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rope Pattern with Scroll Lever Mortise Lockset features elegant rope detailing that is a timeless classic in home decor. The Rope Pattern Mortise Lockset is available in so many finishes, you'll be able to find one that suits your tastes. Choose from a wide selection of functions including single cylinder, privacy, and panic proof. The Mortise Rope Entryset is for both residential and commercial use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/rope-entry-lockset-omnia-d24570\">Omnia D24570</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Rope Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 24570 Rope Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed levers, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a lever from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever inside and by key outside. The outside lever is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-nickel-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rope Pattern with Scroll Lever Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Rope Pattern with Scroll Lever Mortise Lockset features elegant rope detailing that is a timeless classic in home decor. The Rope Pattern Mortise Lockset is available in so many finishes, you'll be able to find one that suits your tastes. Choose from a wide selection of functions including single cylinder, privacy, and panic proof. The Mortise Rope Entryset is for both residential and commercial use. \r\n\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-24570 Rope Pattern with Scroll Lever Mortise Locks, Omnia 24570 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, Omnia 570 door levers, Omnia Rope design door hardware,"
            },
